#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:76 dea3577ed8754b77808a649dbb873faf
msgid ""
"Connect your PC to The Cube using the USB cables as shown below.  The USB "
"cable connected to the Cube (the black cable shown below) provides power.  "
